    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ CONFIGURATION NEEDED\n\nReplace these placeholders:\n\n1. **YOUR_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN** → Same token as Workflow 1\n2. **YOUR_IG_USER_ID** → Instagram Business account User ID\n3. **YOUR_INSTAGRAM_ACCESS_TOKEN** → From Meta Developer Console\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ IMPORTANT: Set up Telegram Webhook\n\nAfter activating this workflow, copy the **Production Webhook URL** and call:\n```\nhttps://api.telegram.org/botYOUR_TOKEN/setWebhook?url=WEBHOOK_URL\n```\n\n**For local setup:** Use ngrok → `ngrok http 5678`\nThen use the ngrok URL as your webhook base.",
