    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📋 How This Workflow Works\n\n1. 📲 Receives Telegram button callback (Approve/Skip)\n2. 🔍 Parses meme data from original message\n3. ✅ Acknowledges the button press\n4. 🔀 Routes: Approved → Instagram | Skipped → Notify\n5. 📤 Posts to Instagram via Graph API (if approved)\n6. 💬 Sends confirmation back to Telegram\n\n**Instagram posting is a 2-step process:**\n1. Create media container (upload image + caption)\n2. Publish the container",
        "height": 320,
